{"about_the_game":"Celebrate 10 years of Killer Instinct! The legendary fighting game franchise returns with an all new Anniversary update with improved matchmaking, balance updates, and more.  The Killer Instinct Anniversary Edition includes all 29 Fighters, and all premium content ever released for Killer Instinct. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhether you're a veteran or a newcomer, you'll find plenty of challenges and rewards in the single-player modes and online multiplayer. Don't miss this opportunity to join the ultimate fight club and prove yourself as the supreme champion of Killer Instinct!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFEATURES:<br />\r\n\u2022 Get the complete collection!  Includes all 29 Fighters from Seasons 1-3, including Eagle, Shin Hisako, and Kilgore<br />\r\n\u2022 Deck out your favorite fighter in style!  Includes all Seasons 1-3 premium Retro Costumes, premium accessories, specialty skins, and more! <br />\r\n\u2022 20 stages with intense stage destruction<br />\r\n\u2022 Competitive online multiplayer matches with state-of-the-art fighting game netcode<br />\r\n\u2022 Test your PVP skills online and compete for place in the top 32 in Monthly Ranked Leagues<br />\r\n\u2022 Extensive Dojo tutorial teaches all the core mechanics for Killer Instinct and Combo Breaker Training to master the art of breaking!<br />\r\n\u2022 Discover the origins and rivalries of your favorite characters in Story Mode<br />\r\n\u2022 Save the world in Shadow Lords, a revolutionary rogue-like single player mode! Build a team of fighters to stop the invasion of Gargos and his army of Mimics!<br />\r\n\u2022 Train an AI Shadow Fighter with your personal style, strategy and combo swagger and Challenge your friends to asynchronous matches in Shadow Lab<br />\r\n\u2022 Fight an endless wave of fighters in Survival mode against enemy AI or Shadow Fighters trained by other players!<br />\r\n\u2022 Customizable Combo Assist Options<br />\r\n\u2022 Permanent VIP Double XP Booster!<br />\r\n\u2022 All retro skins (Note: Omen, Shadow Jago, Kilgore, Shin Hisako do not have retro skins)<br />\r\n\u2022 All premium accessories  (Note: Omen, Shadow Jago, Kilgore, Shin Hisako do not have premium accessories)<br />\r\n\u2022 All released gold skins<br />\r\n\u2022 Specialty Gargos colors Golden God and Argent Shroud<br />\r\n\u2022 Specialty Terror Skins for Fulgore, Mira and Riptor<br />\r\n\u2022 Specialty Holiday Accessories for TJ Combo, Orchid and Sabrewulf<br />\r\n\u2022 All released Ultimate Finishers (for a limited selection of Fighters)<br />\r\n\u2022 Additional Omen Colors 7, 8, 9 unlocked<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSteam Features:<br />\r\n\u2022 Online multiplayer. Pay attention to the Performance Grading test automatically performed before your first match.<br />\r\n\u2022 Steam Achievements<br />\r\n<br />\r\nADDITIONAL PC SPECIFICATIONS:<br />\r\n\u2022 Additional supported peripherals: Windows-compatible keyboard, Xbox One Controller for Windows, Xbox 360 Controller for Windows, and Xbox 360 Fight Sticks.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2625580?t=1719434531","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2625580?t=1719434531","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625580/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1719434531","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625580/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1719434531","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play T